Introduction
The usage of cosmetics in the personal life in this century is inevitable.
Everyone desires to appear beautiful in front of others and is inherited in
the blood since civilization. Cosmetics are used by most people regardless
of their age, race, culture, and gender [1]. Cosmetics can be defined as the

