+- Real ingests committed: 1.
+- Dedup rollups: 1 observed (`oviri2024-nigeria-bathing-soaps-metals` already existed for DOI `10.33003/fjs-2024-0803-2500`; no new source page).
+- Skips: 8.
+- Escalations: 0.
+
+## Commits
+
+- `dfd45d4` — `haji2025-creams-foundations-toxic-elements`, source page for creams/foundations toxic elements.
+- `pending` — audit revision follow-up for `haji2025-creams-foundations-toxic-elements`.
+
+## Triage Breakdown
+
+- `skip:not-food-occurrence`: cockatiel veterinary poisoning case report; irrigated farmland soil Pb/Co method study; aluminum-utensil production soil/water environmental study; Golden Horde archaeological alloy study.
+- `skip:review-only-no-primary-data`: cosmetics heavy-metals review article.
+- `skip:incomplete-metadata`: Nigerian toothpaste occurrence PDF, raw ewes' milk occurrence PDF, and Chennai ready-to-eat chicken occurrence PDF lacked a DOI in PDF text, so they failed this fire's hard metadata gate.
+- `dedup-rollup`: Nigerian bathing soaps paper DOI `10.33003/fjs-2024-0803-2500` already had canonical page `oviri2024-nigeria-bathing-soaps-metals`.
+
+## Audit Queue
