+- Applied audit fixes: preserved Te/Bi/Nb/Ta in source frontmatter, switched mercury page target to `[[metals/mercury-total]]`, added `[[metals/tellurium]]`, and documented the `cosmetic-personal-care` matrix precedent plus missing Bi/Nb/Ta metal-page routing.
+- Audit queue status: `audited-revised`.
+
+## Escalations
